{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e8e94daa4dfb18642f4f6b686f43887aaee720d8beff08f3b58c617f3ce2b52f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4c01317e8d7a521f09daf7da735feafb8d1e5e50fcc182d6c94d62618e79c46",
      "text": "重新转动的故事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b083d2598ee0b383fd82315b2d0431311ecf372877362b7a01228dff8912b9b",
      "text": "看着坦白真相的凉的身影，一希被凉和偶像所吸引。而凉为了实现自己的梦想，前往了315 Production。然而在途中，他发现被不良纠缠的女高中生并上前解围。这时大吾出现了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4c01317e8d7a521f09daf7da735feafb8d1e5e50fcc182d6c94d62618e79c46",
      "text": "重新转动的故事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17e8fbe3f691b6fa9fed3cf8fac84350b23b348c918551568f85080f91221c82",
      "text": "一希的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34d5e2073182bf93759f2f7d1b75c942bd62f1ffcb55dc06e209765a844c775f",
      "text": "…这次也是，拙劣之作。\n根本不是能公之于世的作品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0334e829bdf433a871b8edbd398d9757fc725ba30bb502d10f913fdab3fb75f1",
      "text": "（…这也是理所当然的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd820ccc1d404babdb63176ff8b60504403d3d99f2049011f30039bda69383bf",
      "text": "（…我开始写属于自己的书，\n是为了让父亲看到我真正的模样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4b06e562880e360cd57297a4e1da877862afb748899052fe799068d902d45f4",
      "text": "（…不是影子写手，而是我自己）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d92a51cfe4b6d2c8b9abd76da1531901ed13dfc203ed8c16971e028ca26b229a",
      "text": "…在没有直面故事的世界的情况下写出来的东西。\n书会变得如此丑陋也是理所当然的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79088d8b0c33d321756b0eda6efb5067a10256ac5f9843a48a9371c1eb85a9dd",
      "text": "（…明明心里明白。即便如此依然写下去，是因为……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07aedb21afa20b6977e8cdb3f391c476e9d62be2aa54e84e73be03f0a640dc0d",
      "text": "…无论如何，都想引起父亲的注意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ffcaa43b3e93fbace7b88dea7221795ac2a55157ebc33adf8b1d9d8bffce2d3",
      "text": "…用我自己的心，和语言……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fca2da486216934291aaee86f5d9601b8f710ddd5c65511bd1546760678ed450",
      "text": "（…这样下去的话，\n我们的关系是不会改变的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19540632fec9329b9ce69c9a1d3c7d9d110a2403b6a25ee3b789e335e955ad85",
      "text": "（…作家，和影子写手。\n两个人只是在不断地撒谎而已……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1027989f6f521c7f0b4b86b6e5f700019a129fbc0d9d3c843e5547b56413c4a8",
      "text": "…已经，到此为止吧。\n无论是撒谎，还是继续写这样的故事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:500d27e947b48ea441355f1457b5e00b3a4d39ad411da2d3bce4e9c9556d74b1",
      "text": "…我想作为真正的自己活下去……\n想让大家看到真实的我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afe64e7c5d12b5abf3844aa623695baf78219f3b6cbebf49704ec3cd8d5c69cc",
      "text": "（…虽然不知道，该怎么做才好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5d326da6436098b9576e5d9c5fa2badffc3ccce4086bf2923c69efb52531e52",
      "text": "（…停下笔的那一刻，\n说不定就会寸步难行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb80ea8a167bd9b0697145bef7d06e12dec30a15b9ec659983c25a60cfea5768",
      "text": "…但是……再这样继续伪装自己下去的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3142b26ca3a8d2a3b26f71081308257c856cb69d321d1cb77fb4aad99d7411a4",
      "text": "再这样隐瞒自己的真实身份下去……\n对任何人都没有好处，我是这么想的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1766748cbe589d2610559bba39bffdef402b0d5e524610dc44a509546783590",
      "text": "…是谁？刚才的声音……从电视里传来的……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3142b26ca3a8d2a3b26f71081308257c856cb69d321d1cb77fb4aad99d7411a4",
      "text": "再这样隐瞒自己的真实身份下去……\n对任何人都没有好处，我是这么想的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dad07a2d26ea7bd8b32e8df4f89f8ba3f8199c552fdc6ed83af5ef33d9bb9ad",
      "text": "吓到大家了，对不起。\n但是……这是事实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c945e39ea30ae5af60efeb3b4090ed0424c51dd51bad0fa4228bddca3df1fe95",
      "text": "虽然此前一直作为女性偶像在活动，\n但我……其实是个男孩子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9220313dbcfaa484c5617bce4d336b2c8c4cc93bd7d18834ed746fc188a038e",
      "text": "我苦恼了很久。\n被各种各样的人反对，到底要不要坦白……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bed26099878c2f1329b65a3c5b1d9d722f4a85e6cf67c147be478b6d6093475",
      "text": "只要我自己默默忍耐下去的话，\n大概一切就能圆满收场了吧。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23bb208f9f04e9c3511346699b9cfc3d1a669f82f8fddcd2de008e659d832a3d",
      "text": "如果作为偶像的我，舍弃了以真实的面貌歌唱\n这最大的梦想的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a036b1db61b192fafb17512273cb2fb65ba5161724d80019306a8df57dc90228",
      "text": "那我就再也没有，\n向别人畅谈梦想的资格了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24104c121db3865a65b6dd7ba4d8bd974be73984531d7eebc09eb784634badba",
      "text": "正因为现在我鼓起勇气坦白了一切，\n才能够说出这句话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b0538620005885e5c47e20a52b027f851ba680260de0b092c634194b44e9a7d",
      "text": "各位，请不要放弃梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddd2beb5d319b25eaf8fe40ad671a7770d5941105ac1d2e0b846e1073948c9c2",
      "text": "只要还有一件事能做，\n梦想就依然有实现的可能。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:482dfa600b132d891254773d1f7b1b541e0cd4f46e461696033e62995b5d8b9a",
      "text": "最后，请听听看吧。……我真正的歌声！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a2cad500a4286d1e3a0a9ce5a966a445bff998457ba9635d9777cdc80f1e357",
      "text": "…………\n真实的面貌……吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a310b85f65bc47d65135217fabc727b9aed630da147dbd9aa96c0e178e4cc656",
      "text": "那个，315 Production的位置是……\n顺着这条路直走，到了尽头……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad118278f9f45660478c78d4b11a1d6fcb8d1000e0feb3342c51062111c71d93",
      "text": "真是的。石川社长总是这么突如其来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:625a2d13fb476b6e327a91c29bc7d195ee53aec7ca2e6fee58c424d47d3ea728",
      "text": "居然说什么“想要积累作为男性偶像的实力，\n就去315 Production修行吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6515dcb41880ad8296ecf9c33a025985944ccf700539794f7c28ae30cbb8526",
      "text": "不过，多亏了这样我才能向梦想迈进。\n接下来也要加油了！……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0db151d21c65ed08e830cc3ba727b52e6576fe6d57104784be63422b8c6af087",
      "text": "请、请住手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f554544b0ace52c6e70c6859be7d66c4f5916c2bdd04db2be709bdc1a953783",
      "text": "有什么关系嘛，陪我们玩玩呗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eb32ae90747ff4f0d4d361a4994746555288d937b474fa26297fe1ea7e23f59",
      "text": "那是……有女孩子被纠缠了！？糟糕了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81232a91287f6cfd1584b02fbd80b99ffe56426fa4f2382b065e3b8a2fc9171f",
      "text": "住手！她明明很不愿意啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0309ef07ae82c59dd7ebefccd8fd24fb21a2b7786d66c7f2bea885ef3f8532aa",
      "text": "搞什么啊，别来碍事……等等，\n哎呀……这个女孩子也很可爱嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffac45a0d6c10a633299b7b24df25a4256811b76ef9c0052d108dc3e3d7574c3",
      "text": "和我们一起去玩嘛。\n来，跟我们走吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5620373873b20437adbc1b6939cdb83dcd03779b9632e98f756f4aeb88f71ea6",
      "text": "我、我是男孩子，我才不去！\n你的手，快放……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c7b5b52b617eff234d52d2858e15eb6ae5b26f420d819f98b31bc5c403ea333",
      "text": "强行带走不愿意的姑娘们，\n可不是什么值得夸奖的行为啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b84f534d6ac23514d95e26145432544c2a91214a68b97aeb7d8770429fbf03af",
      "text": "啊？你是谁啊，混账！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:232d95bb6c1d85594620ccb7b1386d58f343bc437c4b0704151a980b206a7a2b",
      "text": "俺是谁都无所谓吧？对企图对姑娘们动粗的\n家伙，俺可没名字好报的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8476397b7bed1a44d00b35c27806e59c3e684cb5f560539688e41e4b9c942f14",
      "text": "都说了，我是男生啦～～！\n呜呜，我看起来真有那么像女孩子吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36f9c4ef4744f93e54ba6fc6f72ee0baa642cd2f5250927d2a7830447c480d0b",
      "text": "这小鬼，挑了个好时候插手啊。\n你应该知道后果吧，喂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60684844f06fafa5112b0cfd1a1403e61642df3fd6b87e00fe0f823043b17b84",
      "text": "哎呀，真是群精神饱满的家伙。\n不过，做坏事可不行。嘿咻！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0c774460baa460e175c9a14c21b42bd0832622c190dfea6bedc42f40f65979f",
      "text": "哇啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:832d90323781f760bd48b7402c04e96b135894449a252fc1ef8b22072d073ecd",
      "text": "来，你们两个。趁现在快跑！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:184b107d1a71f7e56d23c2957ba72666d64d6fd91b9e943f5638a9793558dc70",
      "text": "谢谢、非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64eb4ac47ab21abe1b3e8cf04842c465aec5756a4cb5e47b8c3655b42d7edb19",
      "text": "那边的姑娘也……等等，嗯？\n你该不会是……秋月凉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78457266e2672b7963fac1102461c75a55f6582ce6a848a44ef8ce8c4b6ab3a5",
      "text": "可恶啊～～竟敢对我们动手！\n别以为能就这么算了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99dc8bc6f5d429ab25429ed0aa8b90b7b30dea5d93c3ddbaabe8087aac70c525",
      "text": "哎呀，说话等会儿再说。一起逃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a62c3ca4473b2f7c99b690b03b78c1ff97494287604ab5aed89dcf47f04edd1b",
      "text": "诶？啊，等一下……！\n……嘎哦哦哦嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3015868d454247a3508eb32e39f5551ba20ca7744d713869fff891f4f2659b41",
      "text": "……哈啊……哈啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:973580dbc3e7d5057f8d36e2e3372f98d898a94e5bdfdb6535122b09405c46fc",
      "text": "呼……！跑到这里应该就没事了吧。\n要不要在那边的长椅上稍微休息下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88e5af35d43f54bdf3976b946202b792d9ee7d1be72bc91a1ffe6ecb9dac97a",
      "text": "噢，那边正好有台自动售货机。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebf24d18ceef48ae31ad761e7a25a84f73f403f1c386bfc7cb9c3dd856ff1ee5",
      "text": "喂，饮料这个可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1e0ed33fa531ef08ae9f0399ada9ff8500d6ad651e30bad7e1a8f095343ba1e",
      "text": "啊，嗯、嗯！\n那个……刚才救了我真是太感谢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c679ef13e0056bc27daa84ab5d178b7035211a4e124d5ba91c62d07ca1133d0a",
      "text": "而且，还请我喝饮料……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f0d41207c4ae261b6ace27117a746bb560c60b61e888d4a4b66c8a44f514d7f",
      "text": "不用在意。\n比起那个，稍微冷静下来了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0957be7f105db0a9a446195af77b64f7d435c09c287e4046586f3151d8ac0549",
      "text": "嗯，多亏了你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b75924739414f25a95da9a9beb401e5ca5e1f45cf959e7df65ebf568c5e08da3",
      "text": "那太好了。\n我说，接着刚才的话题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:097aea04d9ba78a7500f1196e0d930fbe4d3b3bf0fb903ae4c35216253833b41",
      "text": "你是秋月凉吧？那个偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29122617ff65f3beb7039c95db430236d5b2266ca124454879c0a3bb0c823de8",
      "text": "诶？你认识我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9681b62fc1b3834baf99c6c62d6d047590028ba819341b6606eb19a928fda7c",
      "text": "噢！话说……这么说来，\n俺还没报上自己的名字呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_f:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba24f3e456327abf1a83838a5220b72501d68b38e06d1dabae045f489cb681c1",
      "text": "俺是兜大吾。请多指教啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72aea5431e00b111db2eda58e12c9ce02f1b3b48d66046d466e2885ee35a633d",
      "text": "话说回来，救下的人竟然是\n那个顶尖偶像秋月凉啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a2f7e22a3ea289e111dc886dd3bd5cd652a21fd2bbe25384792a09e6de5c94c",
      "text": "发现的时候吓了一跳呢！\n世上真有这种巧合啊，哇哈哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88280192a82cc94aef69e15b8c05974e3ab81dafcf917360a366baf985e23653",
      "text": "那个，现在与其说是顶尖偶像，不如说是正要去\n重新向顶尖偶像发起挑战……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:243485cd23f0a0a5159d82ab915f93218653a2303296fc9d23988a2238bd0912",
      "text": "这次是“作为男性偶像”，吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd4fb41ab48979bfdd6a69f5f0917d402f00e135ba35eea1fccd92ec9f862746",
      "text": "嗯。你知道这个的话，\n是看了电视吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b96db74723524a26c18a5743e96f45d38aa1975144dfa1b637b6e4592caab12e",
      "text": "嗯。那时候的你，超级帅气啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddce5ba2728da0181df199d9a1952a5b32152a38256d67e188f7e0859baefcb0",
      "text": "能在那么多人面前，讲述自己的决意，\n真是个有胆量的家伙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a2522d7a31072b941f06e4ef7566445c85f79915c82535158341534ded5bd30",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿……谢谢你。\n能被你这么说我好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74a62bbe7d3958f6702b99aa8f9f467d3c24cc07afc42c4271cced32d4e2f6cf",
      "text": "我说。偶像这行，\n是能让人这么热血沸腾的事情吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:854062668223e37728191f9736fe172eabf60e866df66c28d1e2c033768d5573",
      "text": "说到底，到底是做什么的啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a898a8b64fb58e5c05fa2605e3ff874b8226d656c8e40c9746315da803535a02",
      "text": "这个嘛～……唱歌跳舞，用帅气的\n表演，给大家带来笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78689f605518cf36f3d9036417e78b71ea1b3124f85bf8d519e6772c4b98508e",
      "text": "我是为了成为帅气的男人，\n才开始以偶像为目标的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7d4bc9afbe49a89ec6bfbf0f9661e6bb27657b0eac168a13cdf4bf2057a4f6f",
      "text": "虽然经历了很多事，结果作为女性偶像\n出道了就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6b074bd74b43c732e07e35401864e187856cc26cf5f1fbd2cd46e5d59572cce",
      "text": "接下来我会在一家叫315 Production的事务所，\n作为男性偶像重新开始！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6a2338fe176be8f424ac51ea48fb99b5b7f24c2ce965a4e9e9ee23e2f54397a",
      "text": "嚯～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a13b2074fcc73eb69f04fec7db4a1209342b66d916d291e997a1f0aa0803225",
      "text": "（唱歌跳舞，给大家带来笑容，吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a07aa5a576f5d62bbb2ae808a2a236cbc3465bf1b189cbd7e9c315a86c7331d",
      "text": "嗯，应该，能重新开始吧……石川社长也说了，\n已经好好跟315 Pro打过招呼了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15a42efd3dc75a7283841af47d28b4a04c6f13603629639b908d6086fa95d9a",
      "text": "哎呀，已经这个时间了！？\n得赶紧去事务所了，不然约好的时间要迟到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7c670fdbe8a5656de030fa42353e8c8a5cb302425f01066c31cf30ebd10bcfc",
      "text": "噢，那把你拉住真是抱歉了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_h:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05623913f69f66ebf6256a2c83c1f334e258bd0a6ea46b70e7c5e20ad8207c17",
      "text": "作为赔罪，俺送你去那个事务所吧。\n要是再被奇怪的家伙纠缠，就交给俺吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0f7c077ba640b505ce97b333d8a15802ba87be92584db478d6b5d260e93ad7e",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n多亏了大吾君，平平安安地到达事务所了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43b7e25786964ec960cc9af3c6316a6b170bf777d5ea395b157bb78da026b6cf",
      "text": "哇哇，果然时间卡得好紧。\n得赶快去打招呼了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5be8e94f3b27beb42033d766cbf01aabec296f07cb14e0d0dc464ac444eb30b6",
      "text": "凉先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e205d262bd182c3275e76c99a3961aa535b6ced8aa43d49e791b0ef3fcbc5119",
      "text": "啊！……是●●●●プロデューサー吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fb8f157135287239689ccdc08ae5137358e69b1d626ab01193d63fcd9706074",
      "text": "是的。从今天起请多多关照！\n……难道说，您迷路了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9065ad6e320caab81d281e5c3e771df8c478cfa60b88e4e33bdaff3bdffed0f",
      "text": "呜呜。对不起，让您担心了。\n其实，在来的路上遇到了这样的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1516ad865e83b67d47b132295b26a6eaa6fb2f45a5fccd0f54100799a278cc6",
      "text": "那可真是不容易啊。\n不好意思，是我没做好向导……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97f3a211b1047e3fb99023dff5e898d00bee9d2295340e02590eb52440b114cb",
      "text": "哪里，没关系的！也是我自己忍不住去多管闲事，\n给各种各样的人添了麻烦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9201d310a5fc1bbcb5991259de21f37f105028d10532195416ea9183c0194119",
      "text": "凉，没什么好失落的。\n想要保护女孩子的样子，很帅气啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04ee7550e08aa50d881bc2f22a7a1cadba0f89539c50c9c5b9455d25c9f98d9f",
      "text": "大吾君……\n今天救了我，真的很谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df37c7b2de632f35ef861902861c04a06eb159c3e74c3c9ba67564c7b96186a9",
      "text": "……呵呵，大吾君真厉害呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_i:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42f45ab2a70512f158febfb90bb039ea13022bad9a7c30892785118aae8c1d5e",
      "text": "和你待在一起，就算有点沮丧，\n也会立刻打起精神来呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_j:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0207704d9253ecfd22340d7d33789c468e938e9598473c4b794b7d294f14fe6",
      "text": "……这样啊。\n和俺待在一起，能打起精神来啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62181cd83dd207f95fbdc62a678c5b4997a76e6f257ab17d08639eda6a62d143",
      "text": "（在广岛的家里，这可是很难\n做到的事啊……好高兴啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5570b1f37a0727079da4d79b7db88d5941cecc8ab741f22d8d0beb34e132f5c",
      "text": "说起来，大吾君，\n你对偶像很有兴趣对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a63ff703207d8bd0c99f622baedbbe5ce43915281c0481c14fd638cbd45454a9",
      "text": "关于偶像到底是什么样的，\n要不要听●●●●プロデューサー讲讲看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e64bc77ed028c5847ed2de8dbd95246cb4bc9fdee73935c034d5fc4241ec971",
      "text": "如果是●●●●プロデューサー的话，\n一定能听到比我讲得更详细的事情哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26011db2a352a49e8ae50fe13edcf42d4791af3e4786eb4c3fca23b564ce2ad6",
      "text": "是啊！如果可以的话，请务必让我为您做个说明。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f97074daff3406b38aef1d9be2c0ab7ef1cf79202e9f4a11cf9383d19a3287f",
      "text": "……偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_j:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07f31f737fcfece1d2d8e35c9e6d9cb51807a235b99a7bd1050a20de9ce35c47",
      "text": "……说得也是呢。\n难得有这样的缘分，就听听看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47cd5f2cdbc0f17721cb453517e89490eaa375fc60ad60228fa39651d7aa7b60",
      "text": "太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a64842efc161e8e69c02ef3d7068835af330be997fc0e8f4c55f31c65881f14d",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n那么，两位请进吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
